vdr-plugin-ohpvstatus (0.5.0-1fnu0~trixie) trixie; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 0.5.0:
    - Optional line "PV Today" with the PV energy of today (--pv-today),
      shown below the battery SoC.
    - Four optional free lines for any openHAB item (--line1..4) with
      their own label (--label1..4) and decimals (--decimals1..4).
    - Wh, kWh, MWh and mWh states are converted, other units are shown
      as openHAB sends them.

 -- Frank Neumann <fnu@vdr-portal.de>  Mon, 02 Nov 2026 15:11:28 +0100

